# SFTP Users Configuration
# Format: username:password:uid:gid:home_directory
# 
# Example entries (change passwords before use):
# customer1:secure_password_1::1001:/home/backups/customer1-site
# customer2:secure_password_2::1002:/home/backups/customer2-site
#
# For production, use SSH keys instead of passwords
# To add SSH key authentication, create a .ssh/authorized_keys file in the user's home directory
